{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552490/extras/cec874347a4a06defc6141e1daef2c59.poster.avif?t=1648159490\" width=318 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552490/extras/cec874347a4a06defc6141e1daef2c59.webm?t=1648159490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552490/extras/cec874347a4a06defc6141e1daef2c59.mp4?t=1648159490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time to get bouncy, get squishy, and get funky!</h2>Bounce into this colourful and cartoony world with <strong><i>BouncyBoi</i></strong> and adventure through various worlds filled with challenging puzzles, cute graphics and funky beats!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552490/extras/9855c5653594545bbd65a4fcbda6e324.webp?t=1648159490\" width=500 height=40 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552490/extras/72018a7cc9ea96c8bf1c25297e61002d.avif?t=1648159490\" width=359 height=104 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who's that Slimeball?!?!</h2>You are BouncyBoi.  A purple bouncy slime who loves to jive and solve puzzles, making his way through Puzzle Land.<br>With good music, great visuals and fun times - this family-friendly casual puzzler will have you bouncing right into action!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552490/extras/9855c5653594545bbd65a4fcbda6e324.webp?t=1648159490\" width=500 height=40 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co